                                    <i data-lucide="hand-coins" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400"></i>
                                    <span>Formulir Pengajuan Pinjaman / Kasbon Gaji</span>
                                </h3>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Karyawan dapat mengajukan kasbon darurat dengan tenor cicilan potong gaji.</p>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Plafon Card -->
                            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 text-white p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-1">
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-emerald-100 font-semibold">Plafon Maksimal Kasbon (70% Gaji Pokok):</span>
                                <h4 id="loan-max-plafon" class="text-lg font-black font-mono">Rp 2.100.000</h4>
                                <div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] text-emerald-100 pt-1 border-t border-emerald-400/40">
                                    <span>Sisa Utang Aktif: <strong id="loan-current-debt">Rp 0</strong></span>
                                    <span>Bisa Diajukan: <strong id="loan-available-limit">Rp 2.100.000</strong></span>
