                            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">branches, branch_settings</p>
                        </div>
                    </label>

                    <label class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/80 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 cursor-pointer flex items-center space-x-3 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="sync-cat-users" class="rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500 w-4 h-4" checked>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-slate-800">👥 Karyawan & Hak Akses</p>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">users, user_roles, role_menu_permissions</p>
                        </div>
                    </label>

                    <label class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/80 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 cursor-pointer flex items-center space-x-3 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="sync-cat-customers" class="rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500 w-4 h-4" checked>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-slate-800">🤝 Pelanggan & Harga Mitra</p>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">customers, categories, mitra_custom_prices</p>
                        </div>
                    </label>

                    <label class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/80 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 cursor-pointer flex items-center space-x-3 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="sync-cat-payments" class="rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500 w-4 h-4" checked>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-slate-800">💳 Pembayaran, Kas & Pajak</p>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">payment_methods, cash_denominations, taxes</p>
                        </div>
                    </label>

                    <label class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/80 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 cursor-pointer flex items-center space-x-3 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="sync-cat-logistics" class="rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500 w-4 h-4" checked>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-slate-800">🚚 Kurir & Armada Pengiriman</p>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">delivery_settings, courier_vehicles</p>
                        </div>
                    </label>

                    <label class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/80 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 cursor-pointer flex items-center space-x-3 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="sync-cat-settings" class="rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500 w-4 h-4" checked>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-slate-800">⚙️ Pengaturan & Shift Awal</p>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">app_settings, opening_shifts, work_shifts</p>
                        </div>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="pt-1">
                    <label class="p-2.5 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl flex items-center space-x-2.5 cursor-pointer text-xs">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="sync-cat-stocks" class="rounded text-amber-600 focus:ring-amber-500 w-4 h-4">
                        <div class="leading-tight">
                            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900">Sinkronkan juga saldo kuantitas stok cabang (branch_stocks)</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-700 block">Biarkan tidak tercentang bila ingin mempertahankan catatan stok fisik lokal kasir offline.</span>
                        </div>
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab Mode Eksekusi -->
            <div class="border-t pt-3 space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 text-xs">
                    <button type="button" onclick="setModalSyncMode('remote')" id="modal-sync-tab-remote" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-xs">
                        Tarik Otomatis (Online HTTP)
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" onclick="setModalSyncMode('file')" id="modal-sync-tab-file" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200">
                        Unggah Berkas Cadangan (Offline JSON)
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Konten Mode Remote -->
                <div id="modal-sync-content-remote" class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-indigo-50/60 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 text-xs text-indigo-900 flex items-start space-x-2.5">
                        <span class="text-base">💡</span>
                        <p class="leading-relaxed">
                            Aplikasi lokal akan menghubungi endpoint hosting secara aman dengan <strong>Token Kunci Sinkronisasi</strong>, lalu melakukan Upsert data master secara otomatis.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-end space-x-2 pt-2">
                        <button type="button" onclick="closeMasterSyncModal()" class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all">
                            Batal
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" id="btn-modal-exec-remote" onclick="executeModalMasterSyncRemote()" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold shadow-md flex items-center space-x-2 transition-all">
                            <i data-lucide="cloud-download" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                            <span>Mulai Tarik Data dari Hosting</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Konten Mode File Upload -->
                <div id="modal-sync-content-file" class="space-y-3 hidden">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50/60 rounded-xl border border-blue-100 text-xs text-blue-900 flex items-start space-x-2.5">
                        <span class="text-base">📁</span>
                        <p class="leading-relaxed">
                            Pilih berkas <strong>esbas_master_data_*.json</strong> yang sebelumnya diunduh dari hosting untuk diselaraskan ke database lokal tanpa perlu koneksi internet langsung.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <input type="file" id="modal-sync-file-input" accept=".json" class="w-full text-xs text-slate-500 file:mr-3 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-xl file:border-0 file:text-xs file:font-bold file:bg-blue-100 file:text-blue-700 hover:file:bg-blue-200 cursor-pointer">
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-end space-x-2 pt-2">
                        <button type="button" onclick="closeMasterSyncModal()" class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all">
                            Batal
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" id="btn-modal-exec-file" onclick="executeModalMasterSyncFile()" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold shadow-md flex items-center space-x-2 transition-all">
                            <i data-lucide="upload" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                            <span>Terapkan Berkas ke Database</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Modal Console & Progress Bar -->
            <div id="modal-sync-console-box" class="space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 hidden">
                <div class="w-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden">
                    <div id="modal-sync-progress-bar" class="bg-indigo-600 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 0%"></div>
                </div>
                <pre id="modal-sync-console" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 text-slate-200 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-mono leading-relaxed max-h-32 overflow-y-auto whitespace-pre-wrap text-emerald-400">Menunggu perintah eksekusi...</pre>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal 17: Pembersihan / Penghapusan Massal Seluruh Data Penjualan (Superadmin Only) -->
    <!-- ============================================================== -->
    <!-- MODAL MASTER RESET & PEMBERSIHAN DATA CABANG (GRANULAR PURGE)  -->
    <!-- ============================================================== -->
    <div id="master-reset-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 max-w-xl w-full p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 max-h-[94vh] overflow-y-auto border-2 border-rose-500/30">
            <!-- Modal Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-rose-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-md">
                        <i data-lucide="refresh-ccw" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-black text-rose-900 text-base flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>Pusat Reset & Pembersihan Data Toko</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 font-bold">Super Admin</span>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-rose-600 font-medium">Reset granular seluruh cabang atau cabang spesifik terpilih</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="closeMasterResetModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1.5 rounded-xl transition-colors">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Form Reset -->
            <form onsubmit="submitMasterResetForm(event)" class="space-y-4 text-xs">
                
                <!-- 1. Pilihan Lingkup Cabang -->
                <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i data-lucide="map-pin" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600"></i>
                            <span>Pilih Cabang Target Reset:</span>
                        </label>
                        <span id="reset-scope-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800">Global (Semua Cabang)</span>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Tombol Cepat Pilihan Scope: Semua Cabang vs Cabang Tertentu -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetTargetBranch('ALL')" id="btn-scope-all" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition-all bg-rose-50 border-rose-600 text-rose-800 shadow-xs">
                            <span>🌐 Semua Cabang (Global)</span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetTargetBranch('SPECIFIC')" id="btn-scope-specific" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition-all bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400">
                            <span>📍 Cabang Spesifik</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <select id="master-reset-branch-select" onchange="updateResetScopeInfo()" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-white border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500 shadow-inner dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                        <option value="ALL">🌐 SEMUA CABANG (Global Reset - Seluruh Database)</option>
                    </select>
                    <p id="reset-scope-desc" class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Operasi akan mengeksekusi reset pada <b>seluruh cabang toko</b> tanpa kecuali.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. Pilihan Rentang Waktu / Tanggal Reset (Seluruh Data vs Tanggal Tertentu) -->
                <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2.5">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i data-lucide="calendar" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600"></i>
                            <span>Pilihan Periode / Rentang Waktu Reset:</span>
                        </label>
                        <span id="reset-date-mode-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-rose-100 text-rose-800">Semua Waktu (All-Time)</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Mode Selector Buttons: Seluruh Data Sekaligus vs Pilih Tanggal -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetDateMode('ALL')" id="btn-date-mode-all" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border-2 text-[11px] font-black flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition-all bg-rose-50 border-rose-600 text-rose-800 shadow-xs">
                            <i data-lucide="database" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                            <span>🔄 Seluruh Data Sekaligus</span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetDateMode('CUSTOM')" id="btn-date-mode-custom" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition-all bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400">
                            <i data-lucide="calendar-range" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                            <span>📅 Pilih Tanggal / Rentang</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Date Picker Container (Hidden saat 'ALL', Muncul saat 'CUSTOM') -->
                    <div id="master-reset-date-container" class="hidden space-y-2 pt-1 border-t border-slate-200">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500">Preset Cepat:</span>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap">
                                <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetDatePreset('today')" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Hari Ini</button>
                                <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetDatePreset('yesterday')" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Kemarin</button>
                                <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetDatePreset('7days')" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">7 Hari</button>
                                <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetDatePreset('30days')" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">30 Hari</button>
                                <button type="button" onclick="setMasterResetDatePreset('this_month')" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Bulan Ini</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 mb-0.5">Dari Tanggal:</label>
                                <input type="date" id="master-reset-start-date" onchange="updateResetDateScopeInfo()" class="w-full p-2 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 mb-0.5">Sampai Tanggal:</label>
                                <input type="date" id="master-reset-end-date" onchange="updateResetDateScopeInfo()" class="w-full p-2 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Checkbox Opsi Kembalikan Stok Fisik dari Penjualan yang Direset -->
                        <label id="container-restore-sales-stock" class="flex items-center space-x-2 pt-1 cursor-pointer">
                            <input type="checkbox" id="reset-opt-restore-stock" checked class="w-4 h-4 rounded text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500">
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-700">Pulihkan / Kembalikan Stok Fisik yang terpotong oleh transaksi penjualan pada tanggal tersebut</span>
                        </label>

                        <!-- Checkbox Opsi Sekaligus Kosongkan Saldo Fisik Cabang (Stok = 0) -->
                        <label id="container-zero-physical-stock" class="flex items-center space-x-2 pt-0.5 cursor-pointer">
                            <input type="checkbox" id="reset-opt-zero-physical-stock" checked class="w-4 h-4 rounded text-rose-600 focus:ring-rose-500">
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-700">Sekaligus nolkan / kosongkan saldo persediaan fisik produk cabang (Stok = 0)</span>
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <p id="reset-date-scope-desc" class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Operasi akan mengeksekusi reset pada <b>seluruh data riwayat transaksi</b> dari awal sistem berjalan.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. Pilihan Opsi Data yang Direset (Checkboxes) -->
                <div class="space-y-2.5">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i data-lucide="check-square" class="w-4 h-4 text-rose-600"></i>
                            <span>Pilih Data yang Ingin Dihapus / Direset:</span>
                        </span>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <button type="button" onclick="toggleSelectAllResetOptions(true)" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Pilih Semua</button>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">•</span>
                            <button type="button" onclick="toggleSelectAllResetOptions(false)" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 hover:underline">Batal Semua</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Option 1: Hapus Stok Seluruh Data / Bersihkan Mutasi Stok -->
                    <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-rose-50/40 dark:hover:bg-rose-950/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="reset-opt-stocks" onchange="updateResetKeepInitialUI()" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded text-rose-600 focus:ring-rose-500">
                        <div class="space-y-0.5">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-900 block flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span id="reset-opt-stocks-title">📦 1. Hapus Stok Seluruh Data</span>
                                <span id="reset-opt-stocks-badge" class="px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded text-[9px] bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 font-semibold">Stok = 0</span>
                            </span>
                            <span id="reset-opt-stocks-desc" class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 block leading-snug">
                                Mengosongkan saldo stok fisik seluruh produk (barang jadi & bahan baku) menjadi 0 pada cabang terpilih / semua cabang, serta membersihkan seluruh riwayat kartu mutasi stok fisik.
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </label>
                    <!-- Sub-opsi Pengecualian Stok: Jangan Hapus Stok Awal -->
                    <label id="reset-keep-initial-stock-wrapper" for="reset-opt-keep-initial-stock" class="-mt-1 ml-7 flex items-start space-x-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 cursor-pointer transition-opacity">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="reset-opt-keep-initial-stock" onchange="onKeepInitialStockToggle()" class="mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 rounded text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500 cursor-pointer">
                        <span class="leading-snug">
                            <span class="block text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800">🛡️ Pengecualian: Jangan Hapus Stok Awal</span>
                            <span class="block text-[10px] text-emerald-700">Riwayat mutasi <b>Stok Awal (INITIAL_STOCK)</b> tetap dipertahankan dan saldo stok produk dikembalikan ke nilai Stok Awal terakhir (bukan 0).</span>
                        </span>
                    </label>

                    <!-- Option 2: Hapus Data Penjualan -->
                    <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-rose-50/40 dark:hover:bg-rose-950/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="reset-opt-sales" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded text-rose-600 focus:ring-rose-500" checked>
                        <div class="space-y-0.5">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-900 block flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span>💰 2. Hapus Data Penjualan</span>
                                <span class="px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded text-[9px] bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 font-semibold">Faktur & Omzet</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 block leading-snug">
                                Menghapus seluruh riwayat transaksi kasir (sales), rincian produk (sale_items), data piutang pelanggan (receivables), dan log pembayaran cicilan pada cabang terpilih / semua cabang.
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </label>

                    <!-- Option 3: Hapus Pemakaian Bahan Baku (BOM) -->
                    <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-rose-50/40 dark:hover:bg-rose-950/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="reset-opt-bom" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded text-rose-600 focus:ring-rose-500">
                        <div class="space-y-0.5">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-900 block flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span>🧪 3. Hapus Pemakaian Bahan Baku (BOM)</span>
                                <span class="px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded text-[9px] bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-semibold">BOM Usage Logs</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 block leading-snug">
                                Membersihkan seluruh log mutasi pemotongan bahan baku BOM (air baku, tutup galon, tisu galon, plastik seal) yang terpotong dari penjualan produk olahan/galon.
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </label>

                    <!-- Option 4: Hapus Laporan & Riwayat Shift, Meteran & Stok Malam -->
                    <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-rose-50/40 dark:hover:bg-rose-950/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="reset-opt-shifts" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded text-rose-600 focus:ring-rose-500" checked>
                        <div class="space-y-0.5">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-900 block flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span>⏱️ 4. Hapus Laporan Shift, Meteran & Stok Acuan Malam</span>
                                <span class="px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded text-[9px] bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 font-semibold">Shifts & Stok Malam</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 block leading-snug">
                                Menghapus riwayat shift kasir (cashier_shifts), rekap sisa stok malam acuan opening toko (stok malam kembali ke 0), rekaman log meteran air, serta pengeluaran kas laci toko pada cabang terpilih / semua cabang.
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </label>

                    <!-- Option 5: Hapus Beban Operasional Cabang -->
                    <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-rose-50/40 dark:hover:bg-rose-950/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="reset-opt-expenses" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded text-rose-600 focus:ring-rose-500">
                        <div class="space-y-0.5">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-900 block flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span>🧾 5. Hapus Beban Operasional Cabang</span>
                                <span class="px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded text-[9px] bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 font-semibold">Buku Beban</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 block leading-snug">
                                Menghapus seluruh buku catatan beban operasional cabang (branch_expenses dan uang makan toko) pada cabang terpilih atau semua cabang secara menyeluruh.
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. Verifikasi PIN & Password Super Admin -->
                <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                            <i data-lucide="shield-alert" class="w-4 h-4 text-rose-600"></i>
                            <span>Otorisasi Kredensial Super Admin <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></span>
                        </label>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Keamanan Sistem</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <div>
                            <input type="password" id="master-reset-admin-pin" placeholder="PIN Superadmin (999999)" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-mono text-center text-xs focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <input type="password" id="master-reset-admin-password" placeholder="Atau Sandi (admin123)" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Masukkan PIN Super Admin (default: <code>999999</code>) atau Kata Sandi (default: <code>admin123</code>).</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 4. Konfirmasi Teks -->
                <div class="p-3.5 bg-rose-50 border border-rose-300 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
                    <label class="block font-black text-rose-900">
                        Ketik Teks Konfirmasi Berikut: <code class="bg-rose-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-rose-950 select-all font-mono">RESET DATA</code>
                    </label>
                    <input type="text" id="master-reset-confirm-text" placeholder="Ketik persis: RESET DATA" autocomplete="off" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-white border-2 border-rose-400 rounded-xl font-black text-rose-800 placeholder-rose-300 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-600 uppercase dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500" required>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-rose-700">Tindakan ini <b>PERMANEN & TIDAK DAPAT DIBATALKAN</b>. Ketik teks di atas untuk mengonfirmasi.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Footer Buttons -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeMasterResetModal()" class="py-2.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 transition-colors">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" id="master-reset-submit-btn" class="py-2.5 bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white rounded-xl font-black shadow-md transition-colors flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5">
                        <i data-lucide="trash-2" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>Eksekusi Reset Sekarang</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

