                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-emerald-800">
                        5 Kolom: <code class="bg-emerald-100/90 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-emerald-900 font-mono font-semibold">Nama Pelanggan, No Telepon, Alamat, Google Maps URL / Koordinat, Kategori Pelanggan</code>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="downloadCustomerImportTemplate()" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold shadow-2xs flex items-center space-x-1.5 shrink-0 transition-colors">
                    <i data-lucide="file-spreadsheet" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <span>Unduh Template Excel (.xlsx)</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Rules & Mandatory Info Box -->
            <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/90 rounded-2xl text-[11px] text-slate-600 space-y-1.5">
                <p class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                    <i data-lucide="info" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-600"></i>
                    <span>Ketentuan Kolom Data Pelanggan:</span>
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-1 list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 pl-1">
                    <li><strong class="text-rose-600 font-bold">*Wajib Diisi:</strong> <strong>Nama Pelanggan</strong> dan <strong>No Telepon</strong>.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-slate-700 font-semibold">Opsional:</strong> <strong>Alamat</strong>, <strong>Google Maps URL / Koordinat</strong>, dan <strong>Kategori Pelanggan</strong>.</li>
                    <li><strong>Google Maps URL / Koordinat:</strong> Mendukung link share Google Maps (<code class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-slate-200/60 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">https://maps.google.com/?q=...</code>, link place, atau koordinat langsung <code class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-slate-200/60 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">-6.2088, 106.8190</code>). Sistem otomatis mengekstrak Latitude & Longitude untuk navigasi kurir & peta geospasial.</li>
                    <li><strong>Kategori Pelanggan:</strong> Pilihan: <code class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-slate-200/60 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">REGULER</code>, <code class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-slate-200/60 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">MEMBER</code>, <code class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-slate-200/60 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">RESELLER</code>, <code class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-slate-200/60 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">MITRA</code>. Jika dikosongkan, otomatis disetel ke <span class="font-semibold text-indigo-700">REGULER</span>.</li>
                    <li><strong>Deduplikasi Cerdas:</strong> Jika No Telepon sudah terdaftar, profil pelanggan tersebut akan otomatis <em>diperbarui (update)</em> tanpa membuat data ganda.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <form onsubmit="submitImportCustomers(event)" class="space-y-4 text-xs">
                <!-- Dropdown Cabang Tujuan Import -->
                <div class="bg-indigo-50/70 p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-100 space-y-1.5">
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                            <i data-lucide="store" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600"></i>
                            <span>Pilih Cabang Tujuan Import: <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></span>
                        </span>
                        <span id="cust-import-branch-badge" class="text-[10px] text-indigo-700 font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-200 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Pilih outlet tujuan</span>
                    </label>
                    <select id="cust-import-branch-select" onchange="onCustomerImportBranchChange()" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 cursor-pointer shadow-2xs dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                        <!-- Populated dynamically via JS -->
                    </select>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-tight">Data pelanggan yang diimport akan ditugaskan ke cabang ini. Validasi pembaruan & deduplikasi data hanya akan memeriksa data cabang terpilih agar tidak salah menimpa cabang lain.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Pilih Berkas Excel / CSV (.xlsx, .xls, .csv):</label>
                    <input type="file" id="cust-import-file-input" accept=".xlsx, .xls, .csv, application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet, application/vnd.ms-excel, text/csv, text/plain" onchange="handleCustomerImportFileSelect(event)" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium file:mr-3 file:py-1 file:px-3 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:text-xs file:font-bold file:bg-emerald-600 file:text-white hover:file:bg-emerald-700 cursor-pointer dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                </div>

                <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center my-1">
                    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 w-full"></div>
                    <span class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 absolute dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Atau Salin & Tempel Langsung</span>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Tempel Baris Data (Bisa Copy-Paste dari Excel / Google Sheets):</label>
                    <textarea id="cust-import-text-input" rows="5" oninput="handleCustomerImportTextChange()" placeholder="Nama Pelanggan,No Telepon,Alamat,Google Maps URL / Koordinat,Kategori&#10;Budi Santoso,081234567890,Jl. Sudirman Kav 12 Jakarta,https://maps.google.com/?q=-6.2088,106.8190,REGULER&#10;Toko Berkah Grosir,085611223344,Jl. Tebet Raya No 45,-6.2380, 106.8520,RESELLER&#10;Ahmad Dani,087812345678,,," class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500"></textarea>
                </div>

                <!-- Preview container if rows detected -->
                <div id="cust-import-preview-box" class="hidden space-y-2">
                    <!-- Banner Konfirmasi Pelanggan Terdaftar di Cabang Lain -->
                    <div id="cust-import-cross-warning-banner" class="hidden p-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl text-xs text-amber-900 space-y-1">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 font-bold text-amber-800">
                            <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0"></i>
                            <span id="cust-import-cross-warning-title">Konfirmasi: Data Sudah Terdaftar di Cabang Lain</span>
                        </div>
                        <p id="cust-import-cross-warning-desc" class="text-[11px] text-amber-700 leading-relaxed"></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                        <span id="cust-import-preview-count" class="font-bold text-slate-700">Pratinjau Data (0 baris):</span>
                        <span id="cust-import-valid-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">Siap Diimport</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="max-h-40 overflow-y-auto border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
                        <table class="w-full text-left text-[11px]">
                            <thead class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 sticky top-0 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="p-2">#</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Nama</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">No Telepon</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Alamat</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Google Maps / LongLat</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Kategori</th>
                                    <th class="p-2 text-center">Status</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="cust-import-preview-tbody" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700">
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeImportCustomerModal()" class="py-2.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 transition-colors">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" id="btn-submit-import-customers" class="py-2.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold shadow-md shadow-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition-colors">
                        <i data-lucide="upload" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>Proses Import Pelanggan</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal FR-ADM-01 / FR-POS-56: Tool Transaksi Pengujian (Import Excel Penjualan & Potong Stok) -->
    <div id="sale-import-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-5 overflow-y-auto hidden">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl max-w-4xl w-full p-6 shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-4 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto border border-slate-100 animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150">
            <!-- Modal Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <span class="p-2.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
                        <i data-lucide="file-spreadsheet" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600"></i>
                    </span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base">Tool Transaksi Pengujian: Import Penjualan & Potong Stok</h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Unggah berkas Excel / CSV penjualan massal untuk simulasi transaksi dan pemotongan stok langsung</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="closeSaleImportModal()" class="p-1.5 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 rounded-lg">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Download Template Banner -->
            <div class="p-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-amber-950">
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 font-bold text-amber-900">
                        <i data-lucide="download" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-700"></i>
                        <span>Template Format Excel Penjualan Pengujian:</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-amber-800">
                        13 Kolom: <code class="bg-amber-100/90 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-amber-900 font-mono font-semibold">No Faktur, Tanggal, SKU Produk, Nama Produk, Varian, Qty, Harga Satuan, Diskon, Nama Pelanggan, Kategori Pelanggan, Metode Bayar, Status Bayar, Catatan</code>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <button type="button" onclick="downloadSaleImportTemplate('xlsx')" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold shadow-2xs flex items-center space-x-1.5 shrink-0 transition-colors">
                        <i data-lucide="file-spreadsheet" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>Unduh Template Excel (.xlsx)</span>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" onclick="downloadSaleImportTemplate('csv')" class="px-3 py-2 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs flex items-center space-x-1 shrink-0 transition-colors">
                        <span>CSV</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Rules & Info Box -->
            <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/90 rounded-2xl text-[11px] text-slate-600 space-y-1.5">
                <p class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                    <i data-lucide="info" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-600"></i>
                    <span>Ketentuan & Perilaku Pemotongan Stok Transaksi:</span>
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-1 list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 pl-1">
                    <li><strong class="text-rose-600 font-bold">*Wajib Diisi:</strong> <strong>SKU Produk</strong> (atau Nama Produk) dan <strong>Qty</strong> (kuantitas penjualan &gt; 0).</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-slate-700 font-semibold">No Faktur (Opsional):</strong> Baris dengan Nomor Faktur yang sama akan otomatis digabung ke dalam 1 transaksi penjualan multi-item. Jika dikosongkan, nomor faktur otomatis digenerate (<code class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-slate-200/60 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">INV/YYYYMMDD/IMP-...</code>).</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-slate-700 font-semibold">Harga Satuan (Opsional):</strong> Jika dikosongkan atau bernilai 0, sistem otomatis mengambil harga jual aktif cabang sesuai tier kategori pelanggan (<span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">REGULER, MEMBER, RESELLER</span>).</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold">⚡ Pemotongan Stok Langsung:</strong> Setiap item yang diimport akan langsung mengurangi saldo stok produk jadi di cabang (<code class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-slate-200/60 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">branch_stocks</code>) dan mencatat mutasi <span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">STOCK_OUT_SALE</span>.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-indigo-700 font-semibold">🧪 Pemotongan Bahan Baku BOM:</strong> Jika produk memiliki formula resep BOM (Base BOM atau Varian BOM), bahan baku terkait (seperti air baku, galon, tutup, tisu) akan otomatis dipotong dan dicatat sebagai mutasi <span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">BOM_DEDUCTION</span>.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <form onsubmit="submitSaleImport(event)" class="space-y-4 text-xs">
                <!-- Dropdown Cabang Tujuan Import -->
                <div id="sale-import-branch-container" class="space-y-1">
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700">Cabang Tujuan Pengujian Transaksi: <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></label>
                    <select id="sale-import-branch-select" onchange="handleSaleImportBranchChange()" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                        <!-- Populated by JS -->
                    </select>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Pilih cabang toko tempat transaksi penjualan dan pengurangan stok fisik akan dieksekusi.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Input File Excel / CSV -->
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700">Pilih Berkas Spreadsheet Penjualan (.xlsx / .xls / .csv):</label>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <input type="file" id="sale-import-file-input" accept=".xlsx, .xls, .csv, text/csv, application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet, application/vnd.ms-excel" onchange="handleSaleImportFileSelect(event)" class="w-full text-xs text-slate-500 file:mr-3 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-xl file:border-0 file:text-xs file:font-bold file:bg-amber-50 file:text-amber-700 hover:file:bg-amber-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-1 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                        <button type="button" onclick="clearSaleImportFile()" class="px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold">Reset</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Alternatif Paste Teks CSV -->
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700">Atau Tempel Teks CSV Penjualan:</label>
                        <button type="button" onclick="toggleSaleImportTextarea()" id="btn-toggle-sale-csv-text" class="text-[10px] text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Tampilkan Kolom Tempel Teks CSV</button>
                    </div>
                    <textarea id="sale-import-text-input" rows="4" placeholder="No Faktur, Tanggal, SKU Produk, Nama Produk, Varian, Qty, Harga Satuan, Diskon, Nama Pelanggan, Kategori Pelanggan, Metode Bayar, Status Bayar, Catatan&#10;TEST-001, 2026-11-01 10:00:00, PRD-00001, Air Mineral Galon 19 Liter, , 5, 18000, 0, Budi Santoso, REGULER, CASH, PAID, Pengujian" oninput="handleSaleImportTextChange()" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-700 hidden dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500"></textarea>
                </div>

                <!-- Live Preview Data Box -->
                <div id="sale-import-preview-box" class="space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 hidden">
                    <!-- KPI Preview Card -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-2.5">
                        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl text-center">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold block">TOTAL BARIS</span>
                            <span id="sale-preview-total-rows" class="text-base font-black text-slate-800">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-3 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-2xl text-center">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-700 font-bold block">BARIS VALID</span>
                            <span id="sale-preview-valid-rows" class="text-base font-black text-emerald-800">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl text-center">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-blue-700 font-bold block">ESTIMASI FAKTUR</span>
                            <span id="sale-preview-unique-invoices" class="text-base font-black text-blue-800">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl text-center">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-700 font-bold block">TOTAL ITEM (QTY)</span>
                            <span id="sale-preview-total-qty" class="text-base font-black text-amber-800">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-3 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl text-center col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-indigo-700 font-bold block">ESTIMASI OMZET</span>
                            <span id="sale-preview-total-omzet" class="text-sm font-black text-indigo-900">Rp 0</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-700" id="sale-import-preview-count">Pratinjau Data Penjualan &amp; Pemotongan Stok:</span>
                        <span id="sale-import-valid-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">0 Baris</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden max-h-60 overflow-y-auto">
                        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-[11px]">
                            <thead class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 sticky top-0 z-10">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="p-2 w-8">#</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Status</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">No Faktur</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">SKU &amp; Produk</th>
                                    <th class="p-2 text-center">Qty</th>
                                    <th class="p-2 text-right">Harga (Rp)</th>
                                    <th class="p-2 text-right">Subtotal (Rp)</th>
                                    <th class="p-2 text-center">Stok (Sblm &rarr; Ssdh)</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Resep BOM</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Pelanggan</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Metode Bayar</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="sale-import-preview-tbody" class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="11" class="p-4 text-center text-slate-400">Pilih berkas Excel untuk menampilkan pratinjau data transaksi.</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeSaleImportModal()" class="py-2.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 transition-colors">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" id="btn-submit-sale-import" class="py-2.5 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold shadow-md shadow-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition-colors">
                        <i data-lucide="zap" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>Eksekusi Import &amp; Potong Stok Sekarang</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal CRUD: Kategori Pelanggan (Aktif & Nonaktif) -->
    <div id="customer-category-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-4 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span id="cust-cat-modal-badge" class="p-2 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 rounded-xl text-lg font-bold">👥</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 id="cust-cat-modal-title" class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base">Tambah Kategori Pelanggan</h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Atur kelompok pelanggan dan tingkat tier harga</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="closeCustomerCategoryModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 text-lg font-bold">✕</button>
            </div>

            <form onsubmit="saveCustomerCategoryForm(event)" class="space-y-3.5 text-xs">
                <input type="hidden" id="cust-cat-id">

                <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2">
                    <div class="col-span-1">
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Emoji:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="cust-cat-emoji" placeholder="👥" maxlength="4" value="👥" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border rounded-xl text-center text-lg font-bold dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-3">
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Kode Sistem: <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></label>
                        <input type="text" id="cust-cat-code" placeholder="Contoh: MEMBER, VIP, RESELLER" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border rounded-xl font-mono uppercase font-bold text-indigo-900 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500" required>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Nama Kategori Pelanggan: <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></label>
                    <input type="text" id="cust-cat-name" placeholder="Contoh: Member Loyalitas Prioritas" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border rounded-xl font-semibold dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500" required>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Tingkat / Tier Harga Terkait: <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></label>
                    <select id="cust-cat-tier" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                        <option value="REGULER">👤 Reguler (Harga Jual Ritel Normal)</option>
                        <option value="MEMBER">⭐ Member VIP (Harga Tier Member)</option>
                        <option value="RESELLER">🛍️ Reseller / Grosir (Harga Tier Reseller)</option>
                        <option value="MITRA">🏢 Mitra B2B (Kontrak Khusus Mitra)</option>
                    </select>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">Menentukan formula harga jual yang otomatis diterapkan saat kasir memilih pelanggan pada kategori ini.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Deskripsi / Peruntukan Kategori:</label>
                    <textarea id="cust-cat-desc" rows="2" placeholder="Keterangan singkat hak istimewa atau kriteria kategori..." class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border rounded-xl dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500"></textarea>
                </div>

                <!-- Status Aktif / Nonaktif Switch -->
                <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <label class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs block">Status Kategori</label>
                        <span id="cust-cat-status-label" class="text-[11px] text-emerald-600 font-semibold">Aktif (Dapat digunakan transaksi & pendaftaran)</span>
                    </div>
                    <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="cust-cat-is-active" class="sr-only peer" checked onchange="onCustomerCatStatusToggleChange()">
                        <div class="w-11 h-6 bg-slate-300 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:border-slate-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-5 after:w-5 after:transition-all peer-checked:bg-emerald-600"></div>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-2">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeCustomerCategoryModal()" class="py-2.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold shadow">Simpan Kategori</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

        <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- MODAL CRUD ATURAN DISKON NOMINAL (modal-discount-rule)    -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <div id="modal-discount-rule" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 hidden overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl max-w-2xl w-full p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 my-auto max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
            <!-- Modal Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                    <span id="disc-rule-modal-badge" class="p-2.5 bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/70 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 rounded-2xl text-xl font-bold">🏷️</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 id="disc-rule-modal-title" class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 text-base">Tambah Aturan Diskon Baru</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Atur potongan nominal per pelanggan, kategori, hari, & metode bayar</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="closeDiscountRuleModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 dark:hover:text-slate-200 p-1.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Form Body -->
            <form id="form-discount-rule" onsubmit="saveDiscountRuleForm(event)" class="space-y-4 text-xs">
                <input type="hidden" id="disc-rule-id">

                <!-- Baris 1: Nama & Kode Promo -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Nama Aturan Diskon / Promo <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></label>
                        <input type="text" id="disc-rule-name" required placeholder="Contoh: Promo Berkah Jumat" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Kode Promo / Voucher</label>
                        <input type="text" id="disc-rule-code" placeholder="Otomatis jika kosong (cth: DISC-JUMAT)" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl font-mono font-bold uppercase text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Baris 2: Nilai Potongan Diskon & Min. Belanja -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-rose-50/70 dark:bg-rose-950/30 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-900/50">
                        <label class="block font-black text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300 mb-1">Potongan Diskon Nominal (Rp) <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></label>
                        <input type="number" id="disc-rule-amount" min="1" required placeholder="5000" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-rose-300 dark:border-rose-700 rounded-xl font-mono font-black text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 mt-1 block">Potongan langsung dalam satuan Rupiah (bukan persentase).</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Syarat Minimum Belanja (Rp)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="disc-rule-min-purchase" min="0" value="0" placeholder="0" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1 block">Isi 0 jika tanpa syarat minimum pembelian keranjang.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Baris 3: Mode Penerapan (AUTO vs MANUAL) -->
                <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Mode Penerapan Promo:</label>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
                        <label class="flex items-start space-x-2.5 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 cursor-pointer hover:border-emerald-500 transition-colors">
                            <input type="radio" name="disc-rule-trigger-mode" value="AUTO" checked class="mt-0.5 text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500">
                            <div>
                                <span class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 block">⚡ AUTO (Otomatis Terpasang)</span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-tight block mt-0.5">Sistem kasir otomatis mendeteksi dan memasang diskon jika pelanggan, hari, & metode bayar sesuai syarat.</span>
                            </div>
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-start space-x-2.5 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 cursor-pointer hover:border-indigo-500 transition-colors">
                            <input type="radio" name="disc-rule-trigger-mode" value="MANUAL" class="mt-0.5 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
                            <div>
                                <span class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 block">🔘 MANUAL (Pilihan Kasir)</span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-tight block mt-0.5">Kasir harus menekan tombol promo di kasir POS untuk memilih dan menerapkan voucher promo ini.</span>
                            </div>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- SEKSI: 4 KRITERIA PENYESUAIAN DISKON -->
                <div class="space-y-3 pt-1">
                    <h4 class="font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                        <i data-lucide="sliders" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                        <span>Kriteria Target Penyesuaian (Multi-Dimensi)</span>
                    </h4>

                    <!-- 1. Kriteria Pelanggan -->
                    <div class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">1. Target Pelanggan:</span>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs">
                                <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer">
                                    <input type="radio" name="disc-scope-cust-type" value="ALL" checked onchange="onDiscScopeCustChange()" class="text-rose-600">
                                    <span>Semua Pelanggan</span>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer">
                                    <input type="radio" name="disc-scope-cust-type" value="SPECIFIC" onchange="onDiscScopeCustChange()" class="text-rose-600">
                                    <span>Pelanggan Tertentu</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="disc-cust-specific-container" class="hidden pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-1.5">
                            <input type="text" id="disc-cust-filter-search" oninput="filterDiscCustomerCheckboxList()" placeholder="Ketik nama atau no. telepon pelanggan..." class="w-full p-1.5 text-xs bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg focus:outline-none">
                            <div id="disc-cust-checkboxes-list" class="max-h-32 overflow-y-auto space-y-1 p-1 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800 text-[11px]">
                                <!-- Populated dynamically -->
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 2. Kriteria Kategori Pelanggan -->
                    <div class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">2. Target Kategori Pelanggan:</span>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs">
                                <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer">
                                    <input type="radio" name="disc-scope-cat-type" value="ALL" checked onchange="onDiscScopeCatChange()" class="text-rose-600">
                                    <span>Semua Kategori</span>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer">
                                    <input type="radio" name="disc-scope-cat-type" value="SPECIFIC" onchange="onDiscScopeCatChange()" class="text-rose-600">
                                    <span>Pilih Kategori</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="disc-cat-specific-container" class="hidden pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-cat-checkbox" value="REGULER" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">REGULER</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-cat-checkbox" value="MEMBER" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">MEMBER VIP</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-cat-checkbox" value="RESELLER" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span class="font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">RESELLER</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-cat-checkbox" value="MITRA" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span class="font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400">MITRA B2B</span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 3. Kriteria Hari Berlaku -->
                    <div class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">3. Target Hari Berlaku:</span>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs">
                                <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer">
                                    <input type="radio" name="disc-scope-day-type" value="ALL" checked onchange="onDiscScopeDayChange()" class="text-rose-600">
                                    <span>Semua Hari (Setiap Hari)</span>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer">
                                    <input type="radio" name="disc-scope-day-type" value="SPECIFIC" onchange="onDiscScopeDayChange()" class="text-rose-600">
                                    <span>Hari Tertentu</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="disc-day-specific-container" class="hidden pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer text-xs">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-day-checkbox" value="SENIN" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Senin</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer text-xs">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-day-checkbox" value="SELASA" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Selasa</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer text-xs">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-day-checkbox" value="RABU" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Rabu</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer text-xs">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-day-checkbox" value="KAMIS" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Kamis</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 px-2 py-1 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/40 border border-rose-300 dark:border-rose-800 rounded-lg cursor-pointer text-xs font-bold text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-day-checkbox" value="JUMAT" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Jumat (Berkah)</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer text-xs">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-day-checkbox" value="SABTU" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Sabtu</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer text-xs">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-day-checkbox" value="MINGGU" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Minggu</span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 4. Kriteria Metode Pembayaran -->
                    <div class="p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">4. Target Metode Pembayaran:</span>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs">
                                <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer">
                                    <input type="radio" name="disc-scope-pay-type" value="ALL" checked onchange="onDiscScopePayChange()" class="text-rose-600">
                                    <span>Semua Metode</span>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer">
                                    <input type="radio" name="disc-scope-pay-type" value="SPECIFIC" onchange="onDiscScopePayChange()" class="text-rose-600">
                                    <span>Metode Tertentu</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="disc-pay-specific-container" class="hidden pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-pay-checkbox" value="CASH" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Tunai (Cash)</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-pay-checkbox" value="QRIS" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">QRIS</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-pay-checkbox" value="TRANSFER" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Transfer Bank</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-pay-checkbox" value="DEBIT" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Kartu Debit</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="disc-pay-checkbox" value="PIUTANG" class="text-rose-600 rounded">
                                <span>Piutang Cust</span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Baris Tambahan: Periode Berlaku, Cabang, Deskripsi, Status -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Masa Berlaku Promo (Mulai):</label>
                        <input type="date" id="disc-rule-start-date" class="w-full p-2 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Masa Berlaku Promo (Selesai):</label>
                        <input type="date" id="disc-rule-end-date" class="w-full p-2 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Berlaku di Outlet Cabang:</label>
                        <select id="disc-rule-branch-id" class="w-full p-2 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
                            <option value="">Semua Cabang (Global)</option>
                            <!-- Populated dynamically -->
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Status Aturan Diskon:</label>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 pt-1">
                            <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" id="disc-rule-is-active" class="sr-only peer" checked>
                                <div class="w-11 h-6 bg-slate-300 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:border-slate-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-5 after:w-5 after:transition-all peer-checked:bg-emerald-600"></div>
                            </label>
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Aktif & Siap Digunakan</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Deskripsi / Keterangan Promo:</label>
                    <textarea id="disc-rule-description" rows="2" placeholder="Catatan internal peruntukan promo atau keterangan voucher..." class="w-full p-2 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500"></textarea>
                </div>

                <!-- Footer Actions -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeDiscountRuleModal()" class="py-2.5 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="py-2.5 bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold shadow cursor-pointer">Simpan Aturan Diskon</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- MODAL PEMILIH PROMO KASIR POS (modal-pos-promo-picker)    -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <div id="modal-pos-promo-picker" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 hidden overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl max-w-lg w-full p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 my-auto max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
            <!-- Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                    <span class="p-2.5 bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/70 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 rounded-2xl text-xl font-bold">🏷️</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 text-base">Pilih Promo Diskon Transaksi</h3>
                        <p id="pos-promo-picker-subtitle" class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Keranjang: Rp 0 • Pelanggan: -</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="closePosPromoPicker()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 dark:hover:text-slate-200 p-1.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- List of Applicable Promos -->
            <div id="pos-promo-picker-list" class="space-y-2.5 max-h-[55vh] overflow-y-auto pr-1">
                <p class="text-center py-6 text-slate-400 text-xs">Memuat daftar promo yang tersedia...</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Bottom Actions -->
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <button type="button" onclick="clearAppliedPromo(); closePosPromoPicker();" class="py-2.5 px-4 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-rose-50 text-slate-700 hover:text-rose-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-rose-950/50 dark:text-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-colors">
                    Lepas / Tanpa Promo
                </button>
                <button type="button" onclick="closePosPromoPicker()" class="py-2.5 px-5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold shadow">
                    Tutup
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Modal 8: Set Harga Kontrak Khusus Mitra (Per Produk) -->
    <div id="mitra-price-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-4 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span class="p-2 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 rounded-xl text-lg">🤝</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base">Harga Kontrak Mitra B2B</h3>
                        <p id="mp-modal-partner-desc" class="text-xs text-emerald-700 font-bold">Atur kesepakatan harga khusus per mitra</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="closeMitraPriceModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-100">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <form onsubmit="saveMitraPriceForm(event)" class="space-y-3.5 text-xs">
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Mitra B2B Rekanan:</label>
                    <select id="mp-customer-id-select" onchange="onMpPartnerSelectChange()" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 cursor-pointer dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500"></select>
                    <input type="hidden" id="mp-customer-id">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Pilih Produk:</label>
                    <select id="mp-product-select" onchange="onMpProductSelectChange()" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 cursor-pointer dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500"></select>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl space-y-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-600">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span>Harga Ritel Standar:</span>
                        <span id="mp-info-retail" class="font-bold text-slate-800">Rp 0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span>Harga Tier Mitra (Master Produk):</span>
                        <span id="mp-info-mitra-default" class="font-bold text-indigo-700">Rp 0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-emerald-800 mb-1">Harga Kontrak Khusus Mitra Ini (Rp):</label>
                    <input type="number" id="mp-custom-price" placeholder="Contoh: 25000" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-emerald-50/50 border border-emerald-300 rounded-xl font-black text-sm text-emerald-950 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500" required>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 block">Harga ini akan diprioritaskan otomatis saat mitra terpilih di POS Kasir.</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Catatan Kesepakatan Kontrak:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="mp-notes" value="Harga Kontrak Suplai Mitra B2B" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeMitraPriceModal()" class="py-2.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 transition-colors">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="py-2.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold shadow transition-colors flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5">
                        <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>Simpan Kontrak</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal 9: Ubah / Set Harga Jual Khusus Cabang -->
    <div id="branch-price-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-4 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span class="p-2 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 rounded-xl text-lg">🏪</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base">Harga Jual Cabang</h3>
                        <p id="bp-modal-branch-desc" class="text-xs text-indigo-700 font-bold">Atur harga jual produk per cabang</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="closeBranchPriceModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-100">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <form onsubmit="saveBranchPriceForm(event)" class="space-y-3.5 text-xs">
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Pilih Cabang (Branch):</label>
                    <select id="bp-branch-id-select" onchange="onBpBranchSelectChange()" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 cursor-pointer dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500"></select>
                    <input type="hidden" id="bp-branch-id">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Pilih Produk:</label>
                    <select id="bp-product-select" onchange="onBpProductSelectChange()" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 cursor-pointer dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500"></select>
                    <input type="hidden" id="bp-product-id">
                </div>
                <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl space-y-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-600">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span>Harga Ritel Pusat (Default):</span>
                        <span id="bp-info-central-retail" class="font-bold text-slate-800">Rp 0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span>Modal HPP Cabang:</span>
                        <span id="bp-info-cogs-display" class="font-bold text-rose-700">Rp 0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">Modal HPP (Rp):</label>
                        <input type="number" id="bp-cogs" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300" readonly>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-indigo-900 mb-1">Harga Jual Cabang (Rp):</label>
                        <input type="number" id="bp-local-price" placeholder="Contoh: 35000" class="w-full p-2.5 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-300 rounded-xl font-black text-indigo-950 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500" required>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <span class="block font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs">Status Penjualan Menu di Cabang Ini</span>
                        <span class="block text-[11px] text-slate-500">Jika dinonaktifkan, menu ini tidak muncul dan tidak dijual di kasir cabang ini</span>
                    </div>
                    <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="bp-is-active" class="sr-only peer" checked>
                        <div class="w-11 h-6 bg-slate-300 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:border-slate-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-5 after:w-5 after:transition-all peer-checked:bg-emerald-600"></div>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <span class="block font-bold text-amber-950 text-xs">🚚 Mode Pengiriman Cabang</span>
                            <span class="block text-[11px] text-amber-800">Atur apakah produk di cabang ini standar, wajib ongkir, atau sudah termasuk ongkir</span>
                        </div>
                        <span id="bp-delivery-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">Default</span>
                    </div>
                    <select id="bp-delivery-mode" onchange="onBpDeliveryModeChange()" class="w-full p-2 bg-white border border-amber-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 dark:placeholder-slate-500">
                        <option value="">(Mengikuti Master Produk)</option>
                        <option value="0">⚪ Standar / Ambil di Toko (Tanpa Wajib Antar)</option>
                        <option value="1">🚚 Wajib Ongkir Tambahan (Dikenakan Tarif Cabang)</option>
                        <option value="2">🎁 Sudah Termasuk Biaya Kirim (Include Ongkir - Tetap Catat Pengirim)</option>
                    </select>
                    <!-- Fallback hidden input for compatibility -->
                    <input type="checkbox" id="bp-is-delivery-required" class="hidden">
